  "type": "function",
  "kind": "visual",
  "title": "Icon",
  "description": "One icon from the Lucide set (ISC licence; vendored in vendor/lucide with its licence and version), about 160 of them for explainers and marketing: arrows, check and x, media, creative tools, goals, people, charts, tech, files, commerce. Drawn as vectors in the theme's accent (or any colour), one stroke weight, optionally traced on over `draw` seconds and popped in. Pair with kit-steps, kit-plate and the charts; takes a theme.",
